  "text": "Skip to main content\nBook Now\nThe studio Brackley keeps coming back to.\n\nOne appointment at a time, with Meghan.\n\nBook Now\nSee Results\n5\non Google\n3-4\nWeek Hold\n300+\nHappy Clients\n2,000+\nTreatments\nOur Services\n\nThree disciplines, one studio\n\nNails\n\nBuilder gel in Brackley that holds three to four weeks. Gel polish, pedicures, and nail art on your natural nail, done properly.\n\nExplore nails\nBrows\n\nBrows in Brackley mapped to your bone structure. HD Brows, lamination, and tinting that frames your face.\n\nExplore brows\nSkin\n\nDermalogica facials in Brackley, assessed on the day. Essential, Renew and Clear, from \u00a350.\n\nExplore skin\nView all services\nWhy MMM Beauty\n\n01\n\nTrained to do it right\n\nVTCT certified and still adding to it. Regular training every year keeps the work current.\n\n02\n\nTime to do it properly\n\nOne client at a time. Every appointment runs at its full pace. The slot on your calendar is yours from start to finish.\n\n03\n\nAftercare guides are on the site\n\nEvery treatment has a dedicated aftercare guide on the site. Everything you need to know, before and after your appointment.\n\nMMM BEAUTY, BRACKLEY\n\nThe next slot is online.\n\nSquare booking takes under two minutes. Or message me directly if you want to talk a treatment through first.\n\nBook your appointment\nTalk to Meghan\n\nFROM THE JOURNAL\n\nStudio notes on nails, brows, and skin\n\n26 APR 2026\n\nSummer Beauty: UV Exposure, Treatment Timing, and Pre Holiday Preparation\n\nSummer in Brackley and surrounding areas (Banbury, Bicester, Towcester, Buckingham) brings longer days, outdoor events, and heightened UV exposure, creating both opportunities and risks for skin and na\n\nRead article\n\u2192\n\n20 APR 2026\n\nThe Complete Bridal Beauty Timeline: When to Book Your Nail, Brow, and Skin Treatments\n\nYour wedding day is one of the most important days of your life, and your appearance matters. But rushing your beauty preparations in the final weeks before \"I do\" can backfire spectacularly. At MMM B\n\nRead article\n\u2192\n\n02 APR 2026\n\nSensitive Skin and Professional Beauty Treatments: What You Need to Know\n\nYou're booking a facial or nail treatment, but you're nervous. Your skin has let you down before. Perhaps it reacted to a moisturiser, or breaks out after threading. Perhaps you've had dermatitis or r\n\nRead article\n\u2192\nView all journal entries \u2192\n\nOne appointment at a time, with Meghan.\n\nBook Now\nVISIT\nThursday 12pm \u2013 8pm\nFriday 12pm \u2013 8pm\nSaturday 9am \u2013 4pm\nClosed Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Sunday\n07449137478\nWhatsApp us\nhello@mmm-beauty.co.uk\nTudor Way, Brackley NN13 6NH \u00b7 Free on-street parking\n\nExact door number provided in your booking confirmation.\n\nEXPLORE\nTreatments\nNails\nBrows\nSkin\nJournal\nAreas we serve\nHELP\nGift cards\nAftercare\nAbout & FAQs\nPolicies\nAccessibility\nCookie settings\nSTUDIO UPDATES\n\nOccasional offers and studio news from Meghan. Unsubscribe any time. See our Privacy Policy.\n\nEmail address\nSubscribe\n\u00a9 2026 MMM Beauty, the trading name of Meghan Meehan, a sole trader \u00b7 Brackley, UK\nWebsite by\nDoman Digital\n\nLumi\n\nLumi can help with treatments, aftercare, or booking questions.\n\nResponses are AI-generated. Conversations are kept for 24 hours to stay in context, then deleted automatically.\n\nOnline\n\nI'm Lumi, MMM Beauty's digital assistant. How can I help you today?\n\nMessage Lumi\n\nWe use optional analytics cookies to improve the site.\n\nAllow\nNo thanks\nSettings",
